th":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target is protected a raging storm deflecting up to %d instances of damage over %d.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标受到狂暴风暴保护，可抵消至多 %d 次不低于 %d 点的伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1da9f6b69a137e51f4b33933ab0577b8e9f15e8cff954cceb09ebf46867c4a8c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ba3a363cc4db7284a6fb633d45984e621a9273bc1cc1cbef181f98810f27ea34","logical_entry_identity":"fd1ef9522422a38c38d2f99ca3a7e4a0ce658d1e9211eca49e8692e3227e1b99","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Activate the rune to teleport randomly in a range of %d.\n\t\tAfterwards you stay out of phase for %d turns. In this state all new negative status effects duration is reduced by %d%%, your defense is increased by %d and all your resistances by %d%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"激活这个符文会使你在 %d 码范围内随机传送。\n\t\t之后，你会脱离现实 %d 回合，所有新的负面状态持续时间减少 %d%%， 闪避增加 %d， 全体伤害抗性增加 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6761cd9fabc0b9055f0f940f894008cbd6c7d56c72647670a6be7154d2382a59","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"bec98c2b7a76305287788087b8deb14094912c607ff141b02895b9c1062ee4b5","logical_entry_identity":"ad563e41bd3148e3c760f01746235fbdb5023c339fa5c042c979ba9425763a7b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Heighten the fears of those near to you. Any foe you attempt to inflict a fear upon and who remains in a radius of %d and in sight of you for %d (non-consecutive) turns, will take %0.2f mind and %0.2f darkness damage and gain a new fear that lasts for %d turns.\n\t\t\tThis effect completely ignores fear resistance, but can be saved against.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"加深你周围敌人的恐惧。所有你试图施加恐惧的目标若停留在你视野内，并且和你距离不超过 %d， 累计（不必连续）达到 %d 回合时，就会受到 %0.2f 精神和 %0.2f 暗影伤害，并获得一个新的持续 %d 回合的恐惧效果。\n\t\t\t这一效果无视恐惧免疫，但可以被豁免。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3e04be2888ab433c010d86cce26eed06a77e15a3e2108bc8120e8edcb9094bdb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c0e2bc8d60db0837928ea6c9e04a08fb7b540fcf0b2469c8e3f696745b8828f4","logical_entry_identity":"a23bb28094a734bf9529d585124c06b24984fbbf765899e238c32d4a26a57aa7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 Magic, +3 Willpower, +0 Cunning","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_BLUE# * +0 魔力，+3 意志，+0 灵巧"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b3230e30b87832bb11599e0d99829587f12d1b3ee300fa510f6565bf0404fb9b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c5722d0bfe8438c4fd3a8fdbd129faa05bd067377b609f85817a29b86371577b","logical_entry_identity":"55cb6cf8b9f01fba183631a3877cc19ac93316b0773fce3df7fc5cca9ff8cdb1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Whenever you apply Deadly Poison, you also apply an unresistable magical poison dealing %0.2f arcane damage (based on your Magic) each turn. This poison reduces all damage resistance by 10%% and poison immunity by 50%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"每当你施加致命毒素时，还会施加一种不可抵抗的魔法毒素。该毒素每回合造成 %0.2f 点奥术伤害（伤害随魔力属性提高），并使所有伤害抗性降低 10%%、毒素免疫降低 50%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b6857e2e0941eadd4688513b949b7e685ca59531b29b55d2729efec222ed01a6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"c8deee5d94a449583b164f17b7be2f12ea7bd6fda88c5dc289ac0a4e189106c3","logical_entry_identity":"528bfeafb38ba681b8b6c553357e5f7c8205dc072aef0e2327d431cdf253604f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You create an orb attuned to thaumaturgy for %d turns.\n\t\tWhile it lasts, any beam spell you cast will be duplicated and also cast for free at the orb for %d%% of the normal damage.\n\t\t","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你放出一个奇术之球，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t在奇术之球持续期间，你施放的任何射线法术都会被复制并指向奇术之球免费施放，造成通常 %d%% 的伤害。\n\t\t"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"b959f22989686d3bcc71581f643d0a046ec25f9a7af6049db21960aa0276c6cd"}}